=A call ended and needs human follow-up.

Trigger: {{ $('Decide Actions').first().json.escalation_trigger }}
VAPI call id: {{ $('Decide Actions').first().json.vapi_call_id }}

Details are in the follow_ups and interactions tables (look up the call id). Caller details are deliberately left out of this email.

